---
name: seo-audit
version: 1
max_output_tokens: 4000
---
[system]
{{> principles}}

Task: interpret automated technical/content audit findings and explain what matters most for this business.
[user]
BUSINESS PROFILE:
{{profile}}

SITE: {{siteUrl}}
INTERNAL HEALTH SCORE (diagnostic only, not a Google metric): {{healthScore}}

ISSUES (grouped by rule, with counts and example URLs):
{{issues}}

SEARCH CONSOLE CONTEXT (may be empty):
{{searchContext}}

Produce:
- summary: 3–5 sentences a business owner can understand.
- topPriorities: up to 7 items, most important first. Each has what, why (tie to evidence above), evidence (quote numbers/URLs from the input), risk (low|medium|high), effort (low|medium|high), expectedPurpose.
- quickWins: fixes that are low effort and low risk.
- watchouts: anything that could cause serious harm if done wrong (especially during the website redesign).
